MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Reverse Engineers Mission
  missionName: Reverse Engineers
  description: The invasion has brought technologies to our world that were never intended for human hands. Complete the Alien Reverse Engineering crisis project and turn captured knowledge into an advantage of our own.
  flavorText: Every shattered vehicle, damaged weapon, abandoned device, and fragment of alien machinery is also a library written in a language of materials and engineering. Scientists will catalog components whose purpose is unclear, reproduce structures whose manufacturing methods seem impossible, and deliberately dismantle machines that others would preserve as priceless artifacts. Understanding may come slowly: one alloy, one power system, one sensor principle, one impossible mechanism at a time. We do not need to copy everything the visitors built. We need to learn enough that the technological distance between us is smaller when the next battle begins. An invasion meant to demonstrate their superiority may become the event that teaches us how that superiority works.
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 4
  objectives:
  - objectiveName: Reverse Engineers
    description: Complete the Alien Reverse Engineering crisis project.
    type: 39
